Package: frc-spotter
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: The robot's team <nobody@localhost>
Depends: systemd, init-system-helpers, polkitd | policykit-1
Conflicts: frc-coprocessor-agent
Replaces: frc-coprocessor-agent
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: an FRC robot's coprocessor agent, for the robot's manager
 A small web service an FRC robot's coprocessor runs, speaking Spotter's
 protocol 2 to the robot program's manager. It runs what its packs declare
 (values collected on a schedule, logs, actions) and measures nothing itself;
 with no packs it reports which computer it is and offers power-off and
 reboot. Packs are folders in /etc/frc-spotter/packs/, or pushed by the robot.
 It bundles its own Java runtime.
